WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.720
It shows you what leadership is,

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:04.340
what bad leadership can do to a country.

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:07.040
Look what happened to the United States,

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.760
and look where we are right now in just a short period of time.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.920
The only question now is how many more lives

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:15.160
will be needlessly lost on both sides.

